[{"title":"哭梅直讲圣俞","author":"郭祥正","text":"生事念死隔，歘如过鸟飞。\n长空不留迹，清叫竟何之。\n死者固已矣，生者谩相思。\n昭亭雪塞山，相遇忘寒饥。\n解剑贳浊酒，果肴躬自携。\n扫除长少分，旷荡文章期。\n赠蒙以大白，自谓无复疑。\n及将起草茅，谨札还先驰。\n邀我采石渡，烂醉霜蟹肥。\n沉吟望夫曲，朗诵天门诗。\n险绝必使和，凡鱼岂龙追。\n篇篇被许可，当友不当师。\n凌晨挂高帆，公行我言归。\n一别三四秋，音问山中稀。\n去年集选曹，僮瘦马力羸。\n访公国东门，问我来何时。\n青刍与白饭，诸子争赍持。\n论新复谈故，谓我今逾奇。\n南还得长篇，万里衔光辉。\n此德未云报，讣音裂肝脾。\n桓桓万人英，不遇终愁羁。\n一官止太学，薄命吁可悲。\n所嗟吾道丧，斯文竟何为。\n譬彼卞子玉，弃置污浊泥。\n凤来无嘉禾，啄肉纷群鸱。\n彼苍厥有主，此理安无欺。\n呜呼如之何，酸嘶复酸嘶。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":47876,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"哭夏寺丞公酉","author":"郭祥正","text":"齐山郁愁烟，镜潭坠孤月。\n佳人去不还，生别成死别。\n有才曾未施，负冤终莫雪。\n世情多反覆，美玉不如铁。\n无路攀魂车，隔江寄清血。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":47877,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"哭子点","author":"郭祥正","text":"五岁养育恩，一朝随埃尘。\n琅琅读书声，在耳犹如新。\n哽哽临绝言，唤爷眉屡颦。\n永痛卑栖邑，医脉非良真。\n微疾遽夭殇，吾家失麒麟。\n嗥天天莫知，拊地地不闻。\n泪迸睛欲枯，肠断鼻愈辛。\n汝卧长夜台，我孤大梦身。\n后嗣复谁望，有车已摧轮。\n佳雏堕危巢，异芳零短春。\n黄泉无白日，青冢多愁云。\n哀弦写悲歌，吊汝冥漠魂。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":47878,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"哭宗叔致政大将军","author":"郭祥正","text":"文锋困挫离场屋，武略纵横勤冕旒。\n国士传家虽有子，将军终老不封侯。\n抱冰末路垂三纪，埋玉空山第一秋。\n馀派江东藉云荫，载瞻遗像涕交流。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":47879,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"故临川太守石公挽词二首 其一","author":"郭祥正","text":"忆昔江头别，悲欢失后期。\n奸言诬直节，枉狱累明时。\n白玉原无玷，青天孰可欺。\n有儿能雪耻，泉壤释馀悲。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":47880,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"故临川太守石公挽词二首 其二","author":"郭祥正","text":"半道逢豺虎，吞声力已穷。\n命从冤狱丧，言有谏臣公。\n玉树埋长夜，金鱼委断蓬。\n旅魂虽获雪，千载起悲风。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":47881,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"陈伯育承事挽词二首 其一","author":"郭祥正","text":"海鹤冰为骨，霜潭月作心。\n要宾唯饮酒，焚券不论金。\n相望萦离恨，何嗟得讣音。\n春回坟草绿，谁伴夜台吟。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":47882,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"陈伯育承事挽词二首 其二","author":"郭祥正","text":"二子皆攀桂，一生唯好吟。\n夜台如得句，泉路孰知音。\n饮态思颓玉，交情失断金。\n奠刍何以报，折尽老夫心。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":47883,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"邹宣德挽词二首 其一","author":"郭祥正","text":"忆昔姑溪上，分携岁月赊。\n清标冰有骨，静德玉无瑕。\n不杀居为戒，传经大厥家。\n西山问仙籍，公合在烟霞。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":47884,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"邹宣德挽词二首 其二","author":"郭祥正","text":"静乐畴能匹，翛然几杖间。\n有儿专使节，无念落尘寰。\n流水归何处，孤云去不还。\n成仙应蜕骨，谁谓掩泉关。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":47885,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"哭漳州蔡温老秀才","author":"郭祥正","text":"交游气概如君少，患难扶持及我多。\n万里相思魂往返，一书报死泪滂沲。\n文场决策终难必，旅馆捐躯可奈何。\n犹得有儿传素业，几时归葬旧山坡。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":47886,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"杨次公侍讲挽词二首 其一","author":"郭祥正","text":"力学窥前古，扶经翊太平。\n乐成天地格，祧正祖宗明。\n知命穷犹达，趋玄死亦生。\n世无班马笔，谁为勒幽铭。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":47887,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"杨次公侍讲挽词二首 其二","author":"郭祥正","text":"孤进终难达，文章误此生。\n才趋王府讲，已梦玉楼成。\n遗箧书千卷，招魂酒一觥。\n空馀淮上月，不到夜台明。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":47888,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"杨次思博士挽词","author":"郭祥正","text":"有志吞戎虏，成书达帝庭。\n长江倾学术，短炬速年龄。\n玉树埋蒿壤，泉台掩夜扃。\n功勋何可问，不得上丹青。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":47889,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"亡友留君仪挽词二首 其一","author":"郭祥正","text":"信报君仪讣，将如吾道何。\n交游亡玉树，涕泪泻金波。\n三子先凋泯，一身缠病痾。\n人生谁不死，遗恨独君多。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":47890,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"亡友留君仪挽词二首 其二","author":"郭祥正","text":"壮子皆先陨，亲丧未启攒。\n病成终不愈，魂散若为安。\n结义从今泯，遗编忍复看。\n亭开基石处，云水想漫漫。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":47891,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"吊故友吴延之屯田","author":"郭祥正","text":"吴老归泉后，人间未有君。\n春深来阳草，月乱采江云。\n孤啸猿求侣，哀鸣雁失群。\n姑溪一樽酒，遥酹五峰坟。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":47892,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"哭亡友李公达","author":"郭祥正","text":"忽得凶音泪不收，可怜英气陨荒幽。\n天垂北斗夜台静，虎啸西风坟树愁。\n学道未行尝自信，高名虽在复何求。\n谩携一榼招魂酒，独对修江想献酬。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":47893,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"吊黄塘寺知白上人","author":"郭祥正","text":"今日黄塘寺，昔年知白师。\n悟禅兼悟律，能画亦能诗。\n旧卷春涵瞑，新坟月掩悲。\n馀生我何有，骑马送衰迟。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":47894,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"吊亡友袁世弼太博","author":"郭祥正","text":"自掩斯人骨，西山秀色低。\n文章惊早悟，寿夭理难齐。\n绝壑沉寒玉，空江没断霓。\n儿孙今卖宅，感旧只酸嘶。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":47895,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"三亡诗","author":"郭祥正","text":"荣翁苦于学，腹实五车书。\n尤明礼乐事，画就百幅图。\n献之神宗朝，不报还旧庐。\n白头著青衫，老愤犹欲舒。\n佐邑曾未赴，瞑目忽已殂。\n何子稍家富，恬不为利拘。\n执笔工词章，科第学有馀。\n终遭有司黜，才命诚难俱。\n今闻亦长往，令我勤悲吁。\n二家各有子，素业传门闾。\n登科既同籍，奔丧又同途。\n李君出世胄，轩轩佩琼琚。\n计偕冠多士，场屋喧名誉。\n晚乃乐高隐，卖药荒村墟。\n愈贫愈自信，纯洁不可污。\n天胡夺其龄，否极泰则无。\n斯人皆旧游，想望空踟蹰。\n顾我虽未死，目眊霜盈须。\n近酒已先恶，趋时迹尤疏。\n飞章乞残骸，轻舟下重湖。\n将投永安泊，访旧相欢娱。\n那知死生隔，三秀同时枯。\n欲为招魂篇，悲风涕沾濡。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":47896,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"拟挽歌五首 其一","author":"郭祥正","text":"百年苦役役，一死已休休。\n惟我方自适，妻子空悲愁。\n满樽奠美酒，满盘荐珍羞。\n我终不可起，汝情谩悠悠。\n送我入蒿里，寂寞无春秋。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":47897,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"拟挽歌五首 其二","author":"郭祥正","text":"形坏影亦灭，有神竟何依。\n漠漠空木中，岂知经四时。\n以此为长年，谁人不同归。\n儿孙汝勿泣，朋旧汝勿悲。\n岁月易经过，冥默终相期。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":47898,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"拟挽歌五首 其三","author":"郭祥正","text":"生前势有殊，死去分始齐。\n且将耳目静，安用亲旧啼。\n鸿雁任南北，日月随东西。\n陵谷亦已变，道化复何为。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":47899,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"拟挽歌五首 其四","author":"郭祥正","text":"于生动以扰，既死静且潜。\n黄土假面目，青草为须髯。\n荣华春风吹，憔悴秋霜沾。\n回嗟在世人，不识此理兼。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":47900,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"拟挽歌五首 其五","author":"郭祥正","text":"枯骨蝼蚁馀，空棺蔓草缠。\n欲诉既无路，欲窥不见天。\n休休可奈何，达道乃自然。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":47901,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"四皓","author":"郭祥正","text":"彼美四贤老，高风万古寒。\n去逃秦鼎镬，归识汉衣冠。\n翼翼羽翰就，堂堂宗社安。\n商山弊庐在，还入白云端。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":47902,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"晚望","author":"郭祥正","text":"久客心尝折，登楼望转迷。\n风倾蘋叶乱，雨重柳条低。\n未得趋金马，何当似木鸡。\n细寻乡国路，愁听暝鸦啼。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":47903,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"即事","author":"郭祥正","text":"北户风欺幌，南桥水拍城。\n柳长无嫩色，莺老有新声。\n书帙看慵卷，茶瓯不厌擎。\n故园何日返，此地独含情。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":47904,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"幽居","author":"郭祥正","text":"春晚堪行乐，幽居独闭门。\n忘形付诗酒，吾道委乾坤。\n坏壁蜗涎乱，残经鼠迹翻。\n交游今已绝，孤坐欲何言。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":47905,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"江亭","author":"郭祥正","text":"江亭孤坐久，野望眼偏明。\n映日浮云簿，摇风细柳轻。\n出墙新笋熟，拍岸晚潮生。\n遣仆沽春酒，幽欢取次成。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":47906,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"遣意","author":"郭祥正","text":"发为烟岚秃，愁因患难添。\n径荒无过客，笋迸任穿檐。\n啅雀谁能遣，惊乌不用占。\n有巾堪漉酒，聊欲效陶潜。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":47907,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"春水","author":"郭祥正","text":"春水碧泱泱，平堤映绿杨。\n田畴资灌溉，鸥鸟共徜徉。\n放饵愁空掣，浮杯兴最长。\n晚风吹细浪，仍送落英香。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":47908,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"早起","author":"郭祥正","text":"客愁偏早起，衰病惬晴明。\n索酒防春瘴，披衣听鸟声。\n旧书慵检阅，新客懒逢迎。\n何日笼樊启，再归溪上耕。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":47909,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"初夜","author":"郭祥正","text":"初月未成魄，瘴天云雾低。\n浦昏船竞入，林密鸟争栖。\n褊性怜幽独，香醪自挈携。\n布衾今夜冷，犹得避儿啼。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":47910,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"可惜","author":"郭祥正","text":"可惜花飞尽，春归客未归。\n艰难行路险，老大赏心稀。\n翰墨谁曾问，渔樵与愿违。\n江干空驻目，藜杖得相依。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":47911,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"客禁","author":"郭祥正","text":"客禁何时释，惊魂梦里归。\n深忧邻虎穴，那得并鱼矶。\n草色欣欣茂，萤光个个微。\n残生苦多难，搔首掩荆扉。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":47912,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"卧柳","author":"郭祥正","text":"冉冉碧濠边，三株细柳眠。\n根攲元著水，叶大镇藏烟。\n不作栋梁用，岂忧斤斧先。\n春风任飘泊，客意亦留连。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":47913,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"水涨","author":"郭祥正","text":"山雨连朝注，溪流没草亭。\n蛟鼍方汹汹，鸿雁自冥冥。\n只恐翻河汉，终当见日星。\n波澜平地作，嗟叹未曾经。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":47914,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"水花","author":"郭祥正","text":"水畔花饶笑，攲枝映小亭。\n日光烘欲醉，江色冷还醒。\n浅白浑迷鹭，残红尚衬萍。\n幽人颇萧索，此地要频经。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":47915,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"西斋二首 其一","author":"郭祥正","text":"西斋吾所构，檐角颇依林。\n潇洒松篁影，暄和燕雀音。\n青春那肯住，白发任相侵。\n稍悟渊明乐，时时抚素琴。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":47916,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"西斋二首 其二","author":"郭祥正","text":"西斋吾所爱，一径绿萝深。\n终日听新鸟，令人忘故林。\n地偏无客到，山润有苔侵。\n祸患须安命，优游不废吟。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":47917,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"南楼","author":"郭祥正","text":"兀坐南楼夜，栏干俯列星。\n村遥喧瓦鼓，塔近震金铃。\n湿草埋昏瘴，飞虫接小萤。\n物生皆有理，吾亦委颓龄。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":47918,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"自贻","author":"郭祥正","text":"自恨心肝拙，题诗愈不工。\n痴迷循磨蚁，辛苦打窗虫。\n妙道知何补，多言自取穷。\n不如长寂默，块尔白头翁。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":47919,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"溪岸","author":"郭祥正","text":"溪岸逢春暮，柔条尽意攀。\n轻鸥翔近渚，好鸟响空山。\n小艇长攲侧，孤云自往还。\n远游成底事，白首忆乡关。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":47920,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"要客","author":"郭祥正","text":"要客来何晚，重乾漉酒巾。\n玉琴虚别操，藤榻恐流尘。\n山暗萧萧雨，花辞短短春。\n杖藜慵缓步，愁杀独游人。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":47921,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"城南","author":"郭祥正","text":"淡沲城南路，参差柳绊烟。\n稻秧才一寸，蚕子始三眠。\n曲折藏花地，暄和载酒天。\n清江深有兴，只欲解归船。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":47922,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"夜兴","author":"郭祥正","text":"日没草堂阴，收书复挂琴。\n闭门人迹绝，危坐客愁深。\n星汉光铓动，湖山气象沈。\n嫦娥如借月，蚊蚋莫相侵。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":47923,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"夕阳","author":"郭祥正","text":"夕阳沈谷口，海水接天南。\n归鸟自成阵，暝山如半酣。\n看云贪仰面，移杖忽遗簪。\n幽独谁相过，人情老始谙。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":47924,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"迁居","author":"郭祥正","text":"殊方留滞客，迁馆避諠哗。\n破榻依寒竹，疏窗对晚花。\n燕归疑识面，鸟噪默怀家。\n囊橐无书卷，新愁有五车。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":47925,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"交游","author":"郭祥正","text":"一作闽南客，幽忧忽过春。\n交游半卿相，踪迹自埃尘。\n未附垂天翼，空成涸辙鳞。\n吾庐松菊在，怅望熟溪滨。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":47926,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"微寒","author":"郭祥正","text":"广潦生寒夜，幽人独倚楼。\n渚涯迷海若，灯火想渔舟。\n雷鼓蛙争响，云天月暗流。\n未应时序变，初夏反如秋。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":47927,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"旅食","author":"郭祥正","text":"旋煮青芹滑，新炊白稻香。\n僧居同淡泊，旅食幸康强。\n未拟沉湘水，深防死耒阳。\n上书终自达，圣世本虞唐。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":47928,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"客问","author":"郭祥正","text":"来时麦未吐，今见秀盈畦。\n投阱还遭石，登云孰有梯。\n尔谗徒似锦，吾醉只如泥。\n行止无劳问，空山杜宇啼。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":47929,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"废阁","author":"郭祥正","text":"叠甓基犹在，排空阁已摧。\n燕愁寻旧栋，蚁蠹傍新苔。\n月色閒圆缺，风声自去来。\n废兴何可问，劫火亦成灰。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":47930,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"松风","author":"郭祥正","text":"夜寂松风度，魂清客枕寒。\n琴声传不尽，诗句写应难。\n骤雨倾瑶砌，真珠落玉盘。\n隐居如可访，吾欲跨翔鸾。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":47931,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"挥扇","author":"郭祥正","text":"四月长汀郭，晴多暑气浓。\n欲眠难藉草，选荫必依松。\n绿水遥思濯，青云底处逢。\n西岩残照尽，挥扇待疏钟。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":47932,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"寓馆","author":"郭祥正","text":"一径松阴合，重门院落深。\n客来听鹊喜，春过惜莺吟。\n风月时经槛，尘埃不到襟。\n黄庭看在手，白雪任盈簪。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":47933,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"松枥","author":"郭祥正","text":"婆娑松与枥，夹径碧濛濛。\n未辨雪霜操，同沾雨露功。\n低枝翻翠盖，垂叶密樊笼。\n他日为梁柱，抡材合至公。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":47934,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"立夏","author":"郭祥正","text":"岁旦辞江国，炎天客瘴乡。\n浴陂群鸟白，含雾野梅黄。\n恨别山随眼，消愁酒满觞。\n残魂终易断，回首只茫茫。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":47935,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"深夜","author":"郭祥正","text":"四天垂翠碧，一水湛星辰。\n寂寞殊方夜，漂流片叶深。\n帝乡劳梦想，客路只风尘。\n钟鼓还催晓，深惭钓渭滨。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":47936,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"竞渡","author":"郭祥正","text":"竞渡传风俗，旁观亦壮哉。\n棹争飞鸟疾，标夺彩龙回。\n江影浑翻锦，歌声远震雷。\n轻生一饷乐，时序密相催。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":47937,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"伤春二首 其一","author":"郭祥正","text":"腊月花开尽，中春不见花。\n柳阴空拂地，草色漫平沙。\n客路心常折，僧窗鬓自华。\n故乡何处是，瘴海暗天涯。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":47938,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"伤春二首 其二","author":"郭祥正","text":"春雨时时暗，春花眼未经。\n生涯随过鸟，世态委浮萍。\n瘴雾何由避，蛮歌不忍听。\n谁家有醇酎，吾欲醉兼醒。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":47939,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"西池","author":"郭祥正","text":"雨涨西池水，微澜拍画桥。\n不愁莲芡没，唯恐栋梁漂。\n扶杖防危步，移床避晚潮。\n何当风日爽，一舞看纤腰。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":47940,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"积潦","author":"郭祥正","text":"积潦连江海，舂撞说剑锋。\n郡城千丈拆，民食五年凶。\n雨脚悬麻直，云头泼墨浓。\n忘机唯白鸟，不解避蛟龙。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":47941,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}}]